{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"tool_call","status":"complete","toolCallId":"01a17b5b-afa4-710d-b6a8-5b44c8358307","toolName":"read_file","args":{"file_path":"/home/user/app/README.md","offset":50,"limit":50},"result":"{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",\"id\":[\"langchain_core\",\"messages\",\"ToolMessage\"],\"kwargs\":{\"status\":\"success\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"    51\\t```bash\\n    52\\tbun run contracts:test\\n    53\\t```\\n    54\\t\\n    55\\tRuns 76 tests: unit matrix (U01-U40), transition matrix (T01-T16), fuzz (rate / duration / attested seconds / random actors), and five Foundry invariants (solvency, totalEscrow sum, owed <= escrow, no double-claim, terminal-state zeroing).\\n    56\\t\\n    57\\t### Run frontend dev server\\n    58\\t\\n    59\\t```bash\\n    60\\tbun run dev\\n    61\\t```\\n    62\\t\\n    63\\tOpen [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173). Connect an injected EVM wallet (MetaMask, Rabby) on Arc Testnet (chain ID 5042002) to make transactions. Read-only browsing works without a wallet.\\n    64\\t\\n    65\\t### Build frontend\\n    66\\t\\n    67\\t```bash\\n    68\\tbun run build\\n    69\\t```\\n    70\\t\\n    71\\t### Lint and typecheck\\n    72\\t\\n    73\\t```bash\\n    74\\tbun run check\\n    75\\t```\\n    76\\t\\n    77\\t### Frontend routes\\n    78\\t\\n    79\\t| Route | Description |\\n    80\\t|---|---|\\n    81\\t| `/` | Home — live contract stats and how it works |\\n    82\\t| `/employer` | Create shifts, attest hours, cancel |\\n    83\\t| `/worker` | Clock in/out, claim USDC |\\n    84\\t| `/shift/:id` | Full per-shift detail and actions |\\n    85\\t| `/proof` | Read-only shift lookup by ID |\\n    86\\t| `/help` | FAQ and contract reference |\\n    87\\t\\n    88\\t### Environment variables\\n    89\\t\\n    90\\tNone required for building, testing, or running the frontend locally. Deploy requires a funded wallet and an RPC endpoint for Arc Mainnet or Testnet; supply them via Foundry's `--rpc-url` and `--private-key` flags (or environment variables) at deploy time.\"}],\"tool_call_id\":\"toolu_bdrk_01WsrDGZUHTXk1mnZof7N284\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"metadata\":{\"versions\":{\"@langchain/core\":\"1.2.18\"}},\"additional_kwargs\":{},\"response_metadata\":{}}}"}}
